meta {
	name: 01_SamePackageRequestAtOnce
	seq: 1
}

docs {
	Scenario: The requester sends the same package request several times at once

		Given the approver has no pending request from the requester for the package
		When the requester sends the same package request five times at the same time
		Then every call returns 200 with the same pending request
		And the requester has exactly one pending request for the package
		And the approver has exactly one pending request for the package
		Finally the requester withdraws the pending requests to clean up

	Skipped until the fix for #3931 is deployed: today the calls can create several requests.
}
